  "prefLabel": "He-P 3012.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-01-18",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3012.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the requirements of a statewide population-based public health surveillance program on birth conditions. The surveillance program shall carry out the provisions established in RSA 141-J.\n\nSource. #9404, eff 3-5-09, EXPIRED: 3-5-17\n\nNew. #12333, INTERIM, eff 7-22-17, EXPIRES: 1-18-18; ss by #12448, eff 1-9-18",
